data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":85,"item_id":"rs_0509ef6a69b5530f016acd3067adb887d290b33c2f6ecc303a","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test structure**\n\nI’m thinking I need to determine whether I should add comprehensive tests by writing new ones or if I can just reuse existing helpers. Maybe I can append or edit them for this purpose? It's really important to include thorough tests to cover everything, especially before the first large test. I wonder if it would be better to keep everything separate for clarity, but I also don’t want to overcomplicate things."}

